WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.340
I'm Lucas Craft.

00:01.560 --> 00:03.180
I'm a psychiatric physician assistant

00:03.180 --> 00:04.560
in Washington State

00:04.560 --> 00:06.240
and I focus on adult ADHD care.

00:06.460 --> 00:08.960
Our first visit together will be 60 minutes long,

00:08.960 --> 00:11.220
followed by objective ADHD testing

00:11.220 --> 00:12.480
and then medication trials.

00:12.920 --> 00:15.120
You can schedule your first appointment on my website.
